  <metadata>
    <name>Gusinje – Ropojanska dolina, circular</name>
    <desc>Circular cycling route 25.3 km long starts from Gusinje and returns to Gusinje. It leads through Prokletije National Park, with an ascent of 571 m and the highest point at 1314 m above sea level. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
